Description: lh-provision - FIDO2 Device Binding & Cryptographic Attestation Invariant
 Cryptographic USB and HID hardware security token provisioning and allowlist policy auditor verifying FIDO2/U2F attestation, VID/PID serial pinning, and udev port-lock enforcement rules.
